{"id":1750758,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-17T11:47:40.716Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1750758,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Hilangnya Kasih","overview":"# Hilangnya Kasih (The Loss of Love)  The story follows Qaisara (Janna Nick) and Fuad (Fezrul Khan), a married couple who have been in love since college. Qaisara still has both her parents, Pak Latif and Mak Mah, while Fuad is an orphan. Fuad is despised by his mother-in-law, Mak Mah, because she feels her daughter could have married a better man. Their marital happiness is disrupted when one night their house is broken into by a burglar. A struggle ensues in which Fuad is hit on the head and his leg is struck with an iron rod. Although Fuad is rescued, he is diagnosed with schizophrenia, a mental illness. He is cared for by Qaisara with great patience. A month passes, and Qaisara returns to work while Fuad is cared for by Pak Latif and Mak Mah. Due to Fuad's uncontrollable condition, he is confined. The constant mental and physical abuse he endures causes Fuad to lose his sanity. Until one day, Fuad loses control and stabs Mak Mah.","popularity":0.0143,"poster_path":"/sLvsjjdAd0TcChQOKzAksdVm765.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2016-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Hilangnya Kasih","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1742342,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Janna Nick","original_name":"Janna Nick","popularity":0.5657,"profile_path":"/iRqpSYd5dH1CvBDaF9I5orls7Yi.jpg","cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a81c750fe14540216c9455f","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":1254722,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Fezrul Khan","original_name":"Fezrul Khan"